<p>You attune your saws to a specific target for 5 turns.</p><p>Each time you strike this target all damage done with steamsaws (including by other talents) is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+6%, +10%, +13%, +15%, +17%.</acronym></p><p>If you strike any other foe the bonus ends.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Metal your foes to death!</span></span></p>